# Flamebraider: "{T}: Add two mana in any combination of colors. Spend this mana only to cast Elemental spells or activate
# abilities of Elemental sources" (CR 106.6, 602.2b). Turn 1 Black Lotus and the Mountain pay for Flamebraider and Bramble
# Familiar (an Elemental Raccoon). Turn 3 the Mountain casts Blazing Rootwalla (a Lizard), so the Flamebraider's {R}{G} is
# the only red mana: it can't cast Lightning Bolt (no Elemental spell) nor pay the Rootwalla's "{R}: +2/+0" (a Lizard
# source) - the refusals - but pays the Familiar's "{1}{G}, {T}, Discard a card: Return this creature to its owner's hand",
# an ability of an Elemental source. Turn 5 the {G}{G} casts the Familiar again, an Elemental spell, the lands left untapped.

